{"id": "DfKOc3YJO7T", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "He dies by sunset tomorrow, or I walk into the fire.\nकल सूर्यास्त तक जयद्रथ जीवित रहा, तो मैं अग्नि में प्रवेश करूँगा।\n\nArjuna came home at dusk to find his son dead. That night he swore a vow the gods themselves feared to see broken, and across the field Drona drew up an army forty-eight miles long to guard one man. (Mahabharata, Drona Parva)\n\nThe Sunset Vow, part 3 of 4. Part 4, The False Sunset, comes next: follow so you don’t miss it.\n\nCould Arjuna reach him before the sun set? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #arjuna #jayadratha #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793452119, "like_count": 53951, "comment_count": 98, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1654941992710323a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.815, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNH2ilgoub1Noef-koiI6-wN6Yfc31Z28xaUJKZs37de87QI581PI9ZvwzryayjvtlAU_kx3rYQLplB0Yg6C4ObhzkkacrVmkeVCWg.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Ado1ygTTVqk5EMJbW8EB53lSXSCAyeOidywpRbB1Yzu6wtPDFnBWsFQPItBfrKtZ_fPkGeScKNSjyMziXATy6rNC&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dBur7whekWkQ7kNvwGqwGoa&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=AE7FY-kzGidKw0IA9MIXPA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSaktsd2sfYG46qmKxQR09RwEG9xX9TcXRSdPHHzqpQCA&oe=6AF3FEF7", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr"